{"4015650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wayside Marina", "steam_appid": 4015650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centered in a sprawl of islands above a dark secret, Starset seems like the perfect spot for a weary traveler to rest. But the twisted forces from the deep have a way of rearing its head above water. As ships start to go missing, the docks lay vacant, and rumors begin to emerge from folks around you. Uncover the fate of these lost vessels and much more as you explore the grottos, untangle puzzles, while fending off wicked foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/49323732c1259e034f92442419b64ada.poster.avif?t=1777246753\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/49323732c1259e034f92442419b64ada.webm?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/49323732c1259e034f92442419b64ada.mp4?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment in Wayside Marina unfolds in front of the player in more ways than just a door and a key. Dungeons will require you to look for the hidden path that is right in front of you or to disrupt the scene around you to move forward. All puzzles start and grow from the core game mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/ff578d8450c01f1279515630b9051cb6.poster.avif?t=1777246753\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/ff578d8450c01f1279515630b9051cb6.webm?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/ff578d8450c01f1279515630b9051cb6.mp4?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The attacks are based around the control sticks in order to utilize the combo system. When engaging combat timing, position and choice of strike allow for a mix of strategy and skill. Creatures have a vast selection of attack styles to challenge you with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/c3824d4f1ca38680d45f2465047ddf46.poster.avif?t=1777246753\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/c3824d4f1ca38680d45f2465047ddf46.webm?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/c3824d4f1ca38680d45f2465047ddf46.mp4?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centered in a sprawl of islands above a dark secret, Starset seems like the perfect spot for a weary traveler to rest. But the twisted forces from the deep have a way of rearing its head above water. As ships start to go missing, the docks lay vacant, and rumors begin to emerge from folks around you. Uncover the fate of these lost vessels and much more as you explore the grottos, untangle puzzles, while fending off wicked foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/49323732c1259e034f92442419b64ada.poster.avif?t=1777246753\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/49323732c1259e034f92442419b64ada.webm?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/49323732c1259e034f92442419b64ada.mp4?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment in Wayside Marina unfolds in front of the player in more ways than just a door and a key. Dungeons will require you to look for the hidden path that is right in front of you or to disrupt the scene around you to move forward. All puzzles start and grow from the core game mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/ff578d8450c01f1279515630b9051cb6.poster.avif?t=1777246753\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/ff578d8450c01f1279515630b9051cb6.webm?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015650/extras/ff578d8450c01f1279515630b9051cb6.mp4?t=1777246753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The attacks are based around the control sticks in order to utilize the combo system. When engaging combat timing, position and choice of strike allow for a mix of s